{title: Swing Low, Sweet Chariot}
{subtitle: Spiritual, Wallis Willis (prima del 1862) - pubblico dominio}
{key: E}
# Testo e accordi: https://de.wikibooks.org/wiki/Liederbuch/_Swing_low,_sweet_chariot (CC BY-SA)
# La fonte usa la notazione tedesca H7 (= B7). Ultima strofa senza gli accordi blues
# opzionali della fonte (C#m7, F#m7).
# Licenza di questo file: CC BY-SA 4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
# Modifiche rispetto alla fonte: convertito in ChordPro, righe divise per lo schermo
# del CardputerZero, note in italiano; testo di pubblico dominio integrato dove serviva.

{start_of_chorus}
[E]Swing low, sweet [A]chari[B7]ot,
[E]coming for to carry me [B7]home.
[E]Swing low, sweet [A]chari[B7]ot,
[E]coming for to [B7]carry me [E]home.
{end_of_chorus}

I [E]looked over Jordan, and [A]what did I [B7]see,
[E]coming for to carry me [B7]home?
A [E]band of angels [A]coming after [B7]me,
[E]coming for to [B7]carry me [E]home.

{chorus}

Some[E]times I'm up, and some[A]times I'm [B7]down,
[E]coming for to carry me [B7]home,
but [E]still my soul feels [A]heavenly [B7]bound,
[E]coming for to [B7]carry me [E]home.

{chorus}

The [E]brightest day that [A]I can [B7]say,
[E]coming for to carry me [B7]home,
when [E]Jesus washed my [A]sins a[B7]way,
[E]coming for to [B7]carry me [E]home.

{chorus}

If you [E]get there be[A]fore I [B7]do,
[E]coming for to carry me [B7]home,
tell [E]all my friends I'm [A]coming [B7]too,
[E]coming for to [B7]carry me [E]home.

{chorus}
